{
  "$schema": "../../../../../schemas/model.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "SparkReplicationRequest, one consumer asking to read one of this module's collections in one shape (warehouse §4.2.2,",
    "owner decisions 2026-10-20). Shipped by MintPlayer.Spark.Replication; written only by the library (registration,",
    "ApproveReplication, RejectReplication), so every attribute is read-only and only QueryRead plus the two decisions",
    "are granted, to the replication:approvers slot. The ReplicationRequests query lists pending requests first;",
    "Diff is the readable difference against the shape delivered when the request arrived. IsPending is stored for the",
    "sort and is not an attribute.",
    "",
    "HAND-AUTHORED. Ids are UUIDv5 of 'replication:SparkReplicationRequest[...]', written by 'npm run stamp:library-model-ids'."
  ],
